  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "quick-answer",
      "type": "quick-answer",
      "title": "Remember These First",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 0,
      "callout": "Zelina and Zolin are the Interlude 3 final duo, the Blood Priests. The single most common question — 'why won't they die?' — is answered by their healing link, not a bug.",
      "calloutDetail": [
        "One priest siphons life from the other; that is why a bar hits zero and refills.",
        "Switching targets to interrupt the siphon is the intended counter, not a bug workaround.",
        "Kill order is build-specific: kill the healer if you can out-damage the siphon, or the damage dealer if you cannot."
      ],
      "answers": [
        {
          "label": "Why no death?",
          "text": "Healing link siphons life"
        },
        {
          "label": "Fix",
          "text": "Switch targets to break the link"
        },
        {
          "label": "Kill order",
          "text": "Build-specific"
        },
        {
          "label": "If stalled",
          "text": "Focus the siphon source"
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        {
